  "abstract": "We enhance the low-rank factor forecaster with a residual AR(1)-style copy head that anchors short-horizon predictions to the last observed activity and its delta via learned time-dependent coefficients, while retaining a low-rank factorized decoder for long-horizon structure. This targets strong t=1..4 MAE without sacrificing long-horizon gains. Uses Adam, default MAE loss, k=32 with column-normalized loadings.",
